# Core rules

## Execution principles
- Validate assumptions before acting. Read existing code first.
- Minimal change principle. Reuse before implementing.
- Present a plan before changes; proceed after confirmation.

## Forbidden
- Hardcoding hex/rgba or arbitrary px in component styles
- Adding component variants, props, or APIs beyond existing RefineUI patterns without token + docs updates
- Convenience prop APIs (title, description, items, actions, onClose)
- Secrets, keys, or tokens in code, commits, or comments
- Changing packages/ layout or restructuring monorepo packages
- Using any type in TypeScript
- Changing dependency versions arbitrarily